@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Copyright Policy & Content Creator Rights — SaveZonix";
}

<section class="legal-page">
    <div class="container container-narrow">
        <partial name="_LegalNav" model='(string)"Copyright"' />

        <div class="legal-header">
            <div class="hero-tag">
                <span class="badge-tag badge-tag">©️ Intellectual Property</span>
            </div>
            <h1 class="legal-title">Copyright Policy</h1>
            <div class="legal-meta">
                <span>Compliance: International Copyright Treaties &bull; WIPO &bull; Berne Convention</span>
                <span>Last Updated: September 15, 2026</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-content">
            <div class="highlight-box">
                <strong>Our Commitment:</strong> SaveZonix deeply respects the intellectual property rights of content creators, independent artists, and digital broadcasters worldwide. We are dedicated to ensuring our software functions solely as a neutral technical protocol utility.
            </div>

            <h2>1. Neutral Protocol Architecture</h2>
            <p>SaveZonix is a client-side media transport protocol analyzer, similar in architecture to web browsers, network developer inspectors, and command-line utilities like <code>curl</code> and <code>ffmpeg</code>. The software does not host, store, index, promote, or distribute any video or audio files.</p>

            <h2>2. User Responsibility &amp; Authorization</h2>
            <p>All download operations are initiated solely, directly, and unilaterally by individual users on their personal devices. Users bear the sole responsibility for ensuring they possess the necessary rights, licenses, or statutory exemptions to record or archive any media accessed.</p>

            <h2>3. Anti-Infringement Safeguards</h2>
            <p>SaveZonix does not encourage or facilitate copyright infringement. In particular:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>The software contains no public search engine, index, or directory of copyrighted videos.</li>
                <li>The software contains no DRM bypass modules for commercial subscription services.</li>
                <li>The software is distributed for legitimate educational, fair-use, and authorized personal archiving purposes.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>4. Third-Party Trademarks</h2>
            <p>All product names, logos, brands, and registered trademarks mentioned on this website (such as YouTube, Vimeo, Twitch, and others) belong exclusively to their respective owners. Mention of these platforms is for technical compatibility reference only and does not imply endorsement or affiliation.</p>

            <h2>5. Notice for Rights Holders</h2>
            <p>If you are a rights holder and have technical inquiries regarding SaveZonix, please review our <a asp-controller="Legal" asp-action="DMCA">DMCA Procedure</a> or email our compliance team at <a href="mailto:copyright@savezonix.com" class="auth-link">copyright@savezonix.com</a>.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
